---------------
Current project includes:
    - METR-LA traffic data
    - Traffic-state feature engineering
    - XGBoost temporal baseline
    - Traffic-network graph representation
    - GNN-ready graph structure
    - SUMO traffic simulation
    - TraCI signal control
    - Decentralized multi-agent control
    - Heuristic control-policy benchmarking

The current project does NOT claim:
    - trained PPO
    - trained MARL
    - trained GNN/SOTA spatio-temporal learning
